Package: ha4fpai-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8)
Maintainer: WCIS <takomitkm@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: HA4FPAI unified control service (/v1)
 SQLite business store with versioned migrations, unified command pipeline
 with idempotency and confirmations, unified person identity, settings with
 revision fencing, event log, receipts ingest, media upload and a built-in
 task scheduler. Code installs to /usr/lib/ha4fpai-control, state under
 /var/lib/ha4fpai-control, token under /etc/ha4fpai-control. The service unit
 is NOT enabled automatically; start with systemctl enable --now
 ha4fpai-control after reviewing docs/REFACTOR-CHECKLIST.md (A02/A03).
 The legacy standalone task-worker unit is deprecated for standby use.
